    "updated_at": "2019-01-30T19:35:22Z",
    "body": "An empty abstract interface would have implications for the prototype chains, so I think the specific solution proposed here is not the right one. Perhaps this issue is better focused on the problem, which if I read between the lines, is that folks want to allow other return types from getContext(), without editing the spec for getContext()?",
